DTO Folder
===========

This folder contains Data Transfer Object (DTO) classes that define the data structures
for transferring information between the business layer and other layers of the application.

DTOs are used to:
- Encapsulate data being sent over the network or between layers
- Provide a contract for API requests and responses
- Separate internal domain models from external data representations
- Improve performance by controlling which fields are exposed
- Enable data validation and transformation

All DTO classes should be placed in this directory and follow naming conventions
(e.g., UserDTO, CourseDTO, etc.).
